      ":question/id": "5be06e8c-9bde-5584-a889-951f83b4e0bd",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x-270^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=270^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x-270^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 270^\\circ+\\sin x\\sin 270^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(0\\right)+\\sin x\\left(-1\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
